# Prompt templates

Id is `<domain>.<slug>` and must match the directory path and `meta.json` → `id`.

## Files

| `output` in meta.json | Files |
|-----------------------|--------|
| `single` | `prompt.md` |
| `system_user` | `system.md` and `user.md` |

Shared prose: `prompts/_partials/` included as `{{> partial-name}}`.

## Mustache

- Optional block: `{{#field}}…{{/field}}` — use `{{^field}}` for empty/missing
- String lists: `{{#lines}}- {{.}}{{/lines}}` with tags on their own lines when wrapping lines
- Use built-in `has<Field>` and `<name>Is.<value>` (see CONTRIBUTING) instead of custom view logic for booleans

## meta.json

Update `variables` when the schema changes. Run `npm run docs:domain-index` after usage/status changes. Do not edit generated tables inside domain READMEs by hand.

After any `.md` or `meta.json` change: `npm run generate`, then `npm test` or `npm run test:update` if snapshots shift.
